
<section class="page-content">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2>Partner with us</h2>
      <p>We work with a curated selection of retailers who share our values — independent shops, boutique hotels, and design-forward spaces that care about the details. If that sounds like you, we'd love to hear from you.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="wholesale-benefits stagger">
      <div class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">✦</div>
        <h4>50% opening order</h4>
        <p>Competitive wholesale pricing on all products. Minimum opening order of $500.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">◐</div>
        <h4>Net 30 terms</h4>
        <p>Flexible payment terms for established accounts. We make it easy to work with us.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">◈</div>
        <h4>Marketing support</h4>
        <p>Product photography, display materials, and staff training. We're invested in your success.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-split reveal" style="margin:64px 0">
      <div class="page-split-media reveal-clip">
        {%- if section.settings.image_url != blank -%}
          <img src="{{ section.settings.image_url }}" alt="Wholesale" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="page-split-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">What we offer</span>
        <h2>More than products</h2>
        <p>We don't just sell candles. We partner with retailers to create an experience. That means beautiful displays, trained staff who can tell the story, and a commitment to your success. We visit every account at least once a year, and we're always a phone call away.</p>
        <p>Our current retail partners include over 200 shops across North America, from small boutiques in Brooklyn to design-forward hotels in Copenhagen.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal" style="margin-top:64px">
      <h2>Apply</h2>
      <p>Send us a note at <a href="mailto:wholesale@auraandoak.com">wholesale@auraandoak.com</a> with your shop name, location, website (if applicable), and a little about your business. We review applications weekly and respond within 5 business days.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:24px"><a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn--ghost">Get in touch</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Wholesale content",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "image_url", "label": "Image URL" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Wholesale content" }]
}
{% endschema %}
